1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
Reading Task

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,620
The Polynesian Cultural Center

3
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:11,360
Some theme parks are not only amusing, but also educational.

4
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:16,440
Take the Polynesian Cultural Center (PCC) in Hawaii for example.

5
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:22,100
It not only shows visitors the Polynesian way of life but also protects their skills

6
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,480
and culture for the future.

7
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:28,220
Polynesia is the name given to the many groups of small islands

8
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,240
that are spread about the Pacific Ocean.

9
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:38,040
The PCC is set in 42 acres of beautiful countryside where visitors can see seven different traditional

10
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,620
Polynesian island villages.

11
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:45,160
Villagers from many island communities(社团) come to show visitors their styles of dress

12
00:00:45,160 --> 00:00:46,260
and different customs.

13
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:50,360
For example, you can see different skills of the villagers.

14
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:05,380
They also tell you about their social customs and show you their cooking methods

15
00:01:05,380 --> 00:01:06,360
and their dances.

16
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,940
Their most important skill is boat-building,

17
00:01:10,260 --> 00:01:14,700
which allowed the islanders to explore all the islands in the Polynesian Triangle.

18
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:24,000
They were able to find their way using the smell of the wind,

19
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:26,260
the movements of the fish and seaweed,

20
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,620
and the height and direction of the waves.

21
00:01:29,620 --> 00:01:31,180
They were very clever sailors.

22
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:35,620
Now they use those boat-building skills to make long boats

23
00:01:35,620 --> 00:01:39,340
and show the races and battles that they took part in long ago.

24
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:44,900
All this helps keep the skills and technology of the island people alive.
